==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Doge Base]].
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Because of the Assassin Bear's extreme stats, the right strategy is to destroy the base before he spawns by deploying as many DPS units as possible. The Doge Base itself is not threatening due to existence of [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Blockers]], as it has single attack, and if many small meatshields are in play it will only destroy one of them while the Wave gets blocked.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*A fast meatshield that can tank hits for the Wave Shield.
*[[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]]/[[Mightycat (Rare Cat)|Supercat]] - As mentioned before, this stage is impossible without a Wave Shield since many Wave Immune units have poor DPS and tanking is obviously out of the question. Octopus is likely the go-to option for many players, while Supercat can see use on {{4c}} difficulty as it is the only Wave Shield available there.
*[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] - Without Awakened Bahamut's extreme melee DPS, tearing through the Doge Base in less than 2 minutes might be a long shot. His low range isn't an issue as it's still higher than meatshields.
*[[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]] - A cost-efficient unit whose surprisingly strong single attacks can speed things up a fair bit.
*[[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] - If combined with research combos such as [[Biohazard (Combo)|Biohazard]] and [[Bony Bone (Combo)|Bony Bone]], Ramen Cat can be spammed to create a massive amount of DPS. However, a Wave Blocker is still needed to negate the waves.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Warlock and Pierre (Uber Rare Cat)|Warlock and Pierre]] - The only unit with Base Destroyer, Warlock and Pierre can quickly reduce the Doge Base to rubble, as there are no other enemies in the stage anyways.
*[[Lesser Demon Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Greater Balrog Cat]] - Boasting immensely powerful single attacks at melee range, Balrog can act as a superior Can Can, adding to the DPS stack that's demolishing the base.
*[[Cat Machine (Uber Rare Cat)|Cat Machine Mk. 3]] - Their true form is required to be helpful, since they are granted Wave Blocker, therefore can shield your attackers very well on 1~{{3c}}. Do remember to shield it with fast meatshields to prevent them falling in battle.

